---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftDiagnosticTask
---
Construct a DiagnosticTask draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Construct a short diagnostic task varying the relevant conceptual feature while controlling unrelated difficulty. Include an independently checked answer space and accessible wording; avoid hints that reveal which hypothesis the system expects to confirm.
